# FR-PROPERTY-2026

```catala
declaration structure FrProperty2026Input:
  data cadastral_value content money
  data municipal_rate_bps content integer

declaration scope FrProperty2026:
  input input_data content FrProperty2026Input
  internal cadastral_value_cents content money
  internal municipal_rate_bps content integer
  internal taxable_base_cents content money
  internal property_tax_cents content money
  output cadastral_value_eur content money
  output taxable_base_eur content money
  output property_tax_eur content money
  output municipal_rate_percent content decimal

scope FrProperty2026:
  definition cadastral_value_cents equals input_data.cadastral_value
  definition municipal_rate_bps equals input_data.municipal_rate_bps
  definition taxable_base_cents equals (cadastral_value_cents * ((decimal of 5000) / 10000.0))
  definition property_tax_cents equals (taxable_base_cents * ((decimal of municipal_rate_bps) / 10000.0))
  definition cadastral_value_eur equals cadastral_value_cents
  definition taxable_base_eur equals taxable_base_cents
  definition property_tax_eur equals property_tax_cents
  definition municipal_rate_percent equals ((decimal of municipal_rate_bps) / (decimal of 100))
```
